   368| *
   369| * CRITICAL: This function tries at most ONE fallback provider with a DIFFERENT
   370| * credential. It does NOT retry the same expired key. The primary provider's
   371| * key is excluded from the fallback chain — only providers with their own
   372| * separate env var key are candidates.
